;; into 6-2 itself, rising out of the pipe the bonus room's own pipe leads to (35, 10), so the
;; bonus room is entered again only down the pipe at 19. The clock runs on throughout.
;; Theme and music `dojo`: wooden beams and floor, a shoji band (the `wall` rows, with
;; `ninja:shoji` screens in front), paper lanterns and the round moon window (`ninja` sheet).

